## Do not

- Do not ship a second WhatsApp sender path or bypass `sendTwilioMessagesApi` (compliance rows depend on it).
- Do not log or store codes in clear; `redactSecrets` + HMAC hash only.
- Do not send test messages to numbers other than the owner’s.
